[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5096579555","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121834#issuecomment-5096579555","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121834","id":5096579555,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL8eh4w","user":{"login":"aurpine","id":12262539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYyNTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12262539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine","html_url":"https://github.com/aurpine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:40:27Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T21:28:28Z","body":"Yes this was identified through GDScript function call profiling. Setup: calling an empty instance function in a loop.\r\n\r\nVS2022 Profiling Before:\r\n<img width=\"619\" height=\"260\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3bddfcbd-e344-4449-b18b-e47262272bce\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"625\" height=\"216\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/347237b5-710d-4864-8c23-f62143263228\" />\r\n\r\nHowever I am unable to get results as high in release templates. Maybe MinGW vs MSVC differences?\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\nIn a C++ benchmark, I only notice a difference when build with MSVC. `N=100,000,000` Variant constructions 0.73s (PR) vs 1.11s (master).\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Test snippet</summary>\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n    const int N = 100'000'000;\r\n\r\n    std::vector<Object *> objs;\r\n\r\n    for (int i = 0; i < 1024; i++) {\r\n        objs.push_back(memnew(CustomObject));\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    auto t = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\r\n    for (int i = 0; i < N; i++) {\r\n        Variant a(objs[i & 1023]);\r\n        if (!a) { // So the construction doesn't get optimized out\r\n            break;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    auto t2 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n    auto duration = std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t2 - t).count();\r\n\r\n    print_line(duration / 1000.);\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\nI am not sure if this is change is desired if GCC already optimizes it. I haven't tested clang/LLVM.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5096579555/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5098527217","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121834#issuecomment-5098527217","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121834","id":5098527217,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL-VZ8Q","user":{"login":"aurpine","id":12262539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYyNTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12262539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine","html_url":"https://github.com/aurpine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-28T00:43:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T00:44:37Z","body":"Since we aren't calling an `ObjData` function anymore... we can use `memnew_placement` like the other constructors. I think `&_get_obj()` is the same as `_data._mem`...\r\n\r\nThis makes the profiling results look even better:\r\n<img width=\"624\" height=\"281\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6e55ba40-3285-44e3-9167-6cf28f36e309\" />\r\n\r\nBecause of the struct initializer list with two arguments, the comma is parsed as part of the macro. The fix I found is to add a comma macro. \r\n\r\nRe-requesting review as to not sneak in this substantial change.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5098527217/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5109093674","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121834#issuecomment-5109093674","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121834","id":5109093674,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMIaVKg","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-28T20:05:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T20:05:33Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5109093674/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]